---
subject: Your <%= it.appName %> verification code
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; color: #09090b;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px;">
    <% if (it.type === 'sign-in') { %>Sign-in code<% } else if (it.type === 'forget-password') { %>Password reset code<% } else { %>Verification code<% } %>
  </h1>
  <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px;">
    Use the code below to
    <% if (it.type === 'sign-in') { %>sign in to <%= it.appName %><% } else if (it.type === 'forget-password') { %>reset your password<% } else { %>verify your email address<% } %>.
    It expires in <%= it.expiresInMinutes %> minute<%= it.expiresInMinutes === 1 ? '' : 's' %>.
  </p>
  <p style="font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-align: center; background: #f4f4f5; padding: 16px 24px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 24px 0;">
    <%= it.otp %>
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #71717a; margin: 16px 0 0;">
    If you did not request this code, you can safely ignore this email.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
===TEXT===
Your <%= it.appName %> verification code

Use the code below to
<% if (it.type === 'sign-in') { %>sign in to <%= it.appName %><% } else if (it.type === 'forget-password') { %>reset your password<% } else { %>verify your email address<% } %>.
It expires in <%= it.expiresInMinutes %> minute(s).

  <%= it.otp %>

If you did not request this code, you can safely ignore this email.
